# Restaurant design system

Before generating or editing any visual UI in this project:

1. Read `DESIGN.md` at the project root. Use ONLY the tokens, typography, layout, and motion rules defined there.
2. Apply the **refero-design** skill (`.cursor/skills/refero-design/`) — research references before implementing; never design from generic AI defaults.

## Hard rules

- NEVER use indigo/violet accents, ivory editorial autopilot, or decorative serif word swaps
- NEVER use `transition: all`, pure `#fff`/`#000`, or invented metrics/testimonials
- ALWAYS use named CSS tokens from `tokens.css` and prefers-reduced-motion fallbacks
- Accent color (amber) is CTA-only — not backgrounds or decorative stripes
- When building menu/reservation flows, prioritize clarity and touch-friendly mobile layout

## When unsure

Check `.cursor/skills/refero-design/references/anti-ai-slop.md` before finishing.
